==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Based on ''Malé Islands''; from {{m|en|Malé}}, the name of the main island (from {{bor|en|dv|މާލެ}}) + {{bor|en|sa|द्वीप||island|tr=dvīpá}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈmɒl.diːvz/|/ˈmɔːl.diːvz/|/ˈmɔːl.daɪvz/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈmɔl.daɪvz/|/ˈmæl.daɪvz/}}, {{a|cot-caught merger also}} {{IPA|en|/ˈmɑl.daɪvz/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-Maldives.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=the Maldives}} {{g|p}}

